<title>FRANCE: TENNIS SPOTLIGHT-STATISTICS OF CHANG V BRUGUERA.</title>
<headline>TENNIS SPOTLIGHT-STATISTICS OF CHANG V BRUGUERA.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Statistics of Monday's French Open</p>
<p>men's singles fourth-round match between second seed Michael</p>
<p>Chang of the U.S. and 16th seed Sergi Bruguera of Spain (world</p>
<p>ranking in brackets):</p>
<p>Bruguera won 3-6 6-4 6-3 6-4 in two hours 54 minutes.</p>
<p>    CHANG (2)	 BRUGUERA (19)</p>
<p>    Aces			   6  2</p>
<p>    Double faults		3  3</p>
<p>Percentage first serves 69 63</p>
<p>    Forehand winners	  12 14</p>
<p>    Backhand winners	   7  4</p>
<p>    Unforced errors	   65 49</p>
<p>    nts		17 12</p>
<p>    Breaks of serve	    5  7</p>
</text>
